<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>War Axe</h1>
<p>Type of Weapon: Distanced Hand-to-hand.
</p><p>The term waraxe is not a particular weapon but rather descriptive of an axe designed specifically for use in combat. Waraxes were generally all metal construction and occasionally double-headed. Their axe heads were often longer and broader than a common woodsman’s axe was.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="In_Valhalla">In Valhalla</span></h2>
<p>In Valhalla there is no war axe skill of its own: such a weapon is fought with the skill of the kind of weapon it is. Look at it to see which (see <a cmd='#'>Help Weapons</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
